ction class="comparison-benefit"><div><small>预计净收益 · UI Mock</small><strong>¥ {{ file.uiEstimatedBenefit }}</strong><span>预测情景演示</span></div><div><small>实际节省金额</small><strong class="text-muted">—</strong><span>待访问观测与成本核验</span></div></section></div>
